  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "民事訴訟法及民事訴訟實務",
    "sub_ename": "THE RULES AND PRACTICE OF CIVIL PROCEDURE LAW",
    "describe_ch": "開設對象為於公民營機構服務之在職班學生。民事訴訟法為民事案件於法院中尋求解決之程序規則，本課程藉由民事訴訟規範學習與實務案例介紹，配合在職學生需求，強化其對民事爭議救濟途徑與司法體系運作之認識。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for professionals working in the industry and public sector. The civil procedure law is the procedural rule for a civil dispute which to be resolved in the court. This course introduces the content and practice of civil procedure law in order to strengthens professionals/students' understanding on the remedy of civil dispute and the operation of judicial system.",
